        <mxCell id="c-diag" value="&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellPadding=&quot;0&quot; cellSpacing=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;background-color:#F1F8F2;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DiagnosticoController&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;border-top:1px solid #93A1A1;padding:6px;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;+&lt;/b&gt; guardarTelemetria(Request) : JsonResponse&lt;hr&gt;&lt;i&gt;- cliente : navegador del minijuego&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;- vector[5] llega ya validado&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#220;nico cambio: l&#237;nea 63&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;$this-&gt;rfService-&gt;predecir(...).&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&#8594; $this-&gt;bayes-&gt;predecir(...)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#93A1A1;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="pkg-ctrl">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="40" width="470" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c-val" value="&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellPadding=&quot;0&quot; cellSpacing=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;background-color:#F1F8F2;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ValidacionCientificaController&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;border-top:1px solid #93A1A1;padding:6px;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;+&lt;/b&gt; index() : View&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;+&lt;/b&gt; exportarCSV() : StreamedResponse&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;Solo agregados.&lt;/b&gt; Nunca carga&lt;br&gt;user_id ni enumera filas por persona.&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;No cambia de m&#233;tricas:&lt;/b&gt; lee las mismas&lt;br&gt;columnas. Ahora las predicciones&lt;br&gt;est&#225;n aprendidas, no escritas a mano,&lt;br&gt;as&#237; que la matriz de confusi&#243;n informa&lt;br&gt;algo real.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#93A1A1;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="pkg-ctrl">
          <mxGeometry x="520" y="40" width="470" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c-rf" value="&lt;table border=&quot;0&quot; cellPadding=&quot;0&quot; cellSpacing=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; style=&quot;background-color:#FFE8E8;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;RandomForestService&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;RETIRADO&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;border-top:1px solid #CC6666;padding:6px;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;+&lt;/b&gt; predecir(vector) : array&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#9888; BORRAR en el mismo commit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#8226; RandomForestService.php&lt;br&gt;&#8226; tests/Unit/RandomForestServiceTest.php&lt;br&gt;&#8226; l&#237;nea 63 de DiagnosticoController&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Los 5 &#225;rboles escritos a mano se&lt;br&gt;reemplazan por P(clase|x) aprendida de&lt;br&gt;telemetria_gameplay.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#CC6666;fillColor=none;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="pkg-ctrl">
          <mxGeometry x="1020" y="40" width="460" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="n-inferencia" value="&lt;b&gt;INFERENCIA&#160;&#8212;&#160;en cada partida&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. FeatureRegistry::mapearVectorPosicional()&lt;br&gt;&#160;&#160;[500, 2.0, 20000, 0, 95] &#8594; {latencia: 500, tapping: 2.0, ...}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Para cada clase C en 5 clases:&lt;br&gt;&#160;&#160;logScorer(C) = log P(C) + &#8721;&#7522; log N(x&#7522; | &#956;&#7522;,C, &#963;&#7522;,C)&lt;br&gt;&#160;&#160;log N(x | &#956;, &#963;) = &#8722;ln(&#963;&#183;&#8730;2&#960;) &#8722; (x&#8722;&#956;)&#178; / (2&#963;&#178;)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Normalizaci&#243;n con log-sum-exp:&lt;br&gt;&#160;&#160;Z = logsumExp({logScorer(C)})&lt;br&gt;&#160;&#160;P(C|x) = exp(logScorer(C) &#8722; Z)&#160;&#160;&#8594;&#160;suma 1.0 por construcci&#243;n&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. pred = argmax P(C|x)&#160;&#160;&#8226;&#160;&#160;confianza = P(argmax|x)&#215;100&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#963; se acota por config(&#39;bayes.variance_floor&#39;) para que &#963; &#8594; 0 no produzca divisi&#243;n por cero." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#EEE8D5;strokeColor=#93A1A1;fontColor=#073642;fontSize=11;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1330" width="730" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n-entrenamiento" value="&lt;b&gt;ENTRENAMIENTO&#160;&#8212;&#160;solo a mano&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Una sola pasada sobre telemetria_gameplay.&lt;br&gt;&#8226; Solo se leen las 6 columnas del modelo. La consulta&lt;br&gt;&#160;&#160;NO incluye user_id, as&#237; que el conjunto de&lt;br&gt;&#160;&#160;entrenamiento no puede identificar a nadie.&lt;b&gt;Verosimilitud por clase&lt;/b&gt; (Gaussiana):&lt;br&gt;&#160;&#160;&#956;&#7522;,C&#160;&#160;= (1/N_c) &#8721; x&#7522;&lt;br&gt;&#160;&#160;&#963;&#178;&#7522;,C = (1/N_c) &#8721; (x&#7522; &#8722; &#956;&#7522;,C)&#178;&lt;br&gt;&#160;&#160;&lt;i&gt;(Piso de 1/N_c, no 1/(N_c&#8722;1): el modelo no&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#160;&#160;&lt;i&gt;estima varianza, solo likelihood.)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Priors con suavizado aditivo&lt;/b&gt; (Laplace, &#945;):&lt;br&gt;&#160;&#160;P(C) = (N_c + &#945;) / (N + &#945;&#183;K)&#160;&#160;K = 5 clases&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DEGRADACI&#211;N SEGURA&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Si una clase tiene &amp;lt; min_muestras_por_clase, sus &#956;/&#963;&lt;br&gt;y su prior NO se tocan: se conservan los de config. Una&lt;br&gt;clase escasa no puede vaciar el modelo. El panel lo&lt;br&gt;anuncia en metadatos[&#39;clases_debilitadas&#39;]; no hay&lt;br&gt;degradaci&#243;n silenciosa." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#EEE8D5;strokeColor=#93A1A1;fontColor=#073642;fontSize=11;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="800" y="1330" width="740" height="250" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="e1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=open;dashed=1;strokeColor=#073642;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.25;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c-features" target="c-config">
